* ================================================================
*  CMOS MOSFET Model Library for 5T OTA Project
*  Technology: 180nm Generic Educational CMOS
*
*  MODEL LEVEL: 1 (Shichman-Hodges) -- simplest possible
*  EQUATIONS USED:
*
*  Cutoff   (Vgs < Vt):
*    Id = 0
*
*  Triode   (Vgs > Vt AND Vds < Vgs-Vt):
*    Id = (KP/2)*(W/L)*[2*(Vgs-Vt)*Vds - Vds^2]
*
*  Saturation (Vgs > Vt AND Vds >= Vgs-Vt):
*    Id = (KP/2)*(W/L)*(Vgs-Vt)^2 * (1 + LAMBDA*Vds)
*
*  KEY PARAMETERS:
*   VTO    = Threshold voltage (V)
*   KP     = µ0*Cox = Process transconductance (A/V^2)
*   LAMBDA = Channel-length modulation coefficient (1/V)
*   GAMMA  = Body-effect coefficient (V^0.5)
*   PHI    = Surface potential (V)
* ================================================================

* ================================================================
*  NMOS MODEL (n-channel MOSFET)
*  Carrier: electrons (high mobility ~450 cm²/Vs at 180nm)
* ================================================================
*
*  VTO   = +0.5 V   (positive for NMOS)
*  KP    = 170 µA/V² (= µn * Cox, typical 180nm NMOS)
*         [µn ≈ 450 cm²/Vs, Cox = εox/tox = 3.9*8.85e-12/4e-9 = 8.63 mF/m²]
*  LAMBDA= 0.1 /V   (channel-length modulation; smaller for longer L)
*  GAMMA = 0.4 V^0.5 (body effect)
*  PHI   = 0.7 V    (2φF, surface potential)
*  TOX   = 4 nm     (gate oxide thickness, 180nm process)
*
.model NMOS_Model NMOS
+ Level=1
+ VTO=0.5
+ KP=170e-6
+ GAMMA=0.4
+ PHI=0.7
+ LAMBDA=0.1
+ TOX=4e-9
+ NSUB=1e17
+ LD=10e-9
+ CJ=2.5e-4
+ CJSW=3e-10
+ PB=0.9
+ MJ=0.5
+ MJSW=0.3
+ CGDO=2.0e-10
+ CGSO=2.0e-10

* ================================================================
*  PMOS MODEL (p-channel MOSFET)
*  Carrier: holes (lower mobility ~150 cm²/Vs at 180nm)
*
*  WHY IS KP LOWER FOR PMOS?
*  Holes have ~3x lower mobility than electrons.
*  KPp = µp * Cox ≈ 60 µA/V² (vs 170 µA/V² for NMOS)
*  → PMOS is ~2.8x "weaker" per unit W/L
*
*  VTO   = -0.5 V   (NEGATIVE for PMOS -- turns on when Vgs < Vt)
*  LAMBDA= 0.05 /V  (smaller because PMOS sees slightly longer eff. L)
* ================================================================
.model PMOS_Model PMOS
+ Level=1
+ VTO=-0.5
+ KP=60e-6
+ GAMMA=0.4
+ PHI=0.7
+ LAMBDA=0.05
+ TOX=4e-9
+ NSUB=5e16
+ LD=10e-9
+ CJ=3.5e-4
+ CJSW=4e-10
+ PB=0.9
+ MJ=0.5
+ MJSW=0.3
+ CGDO=2.0e-10
+ CGSO=2.0e-10
